{'symbol': 'KO', 'date': '2023-06-01 15:35:00', 'title': "COCA-COLA BEVERAGES FLORIDA EXECUTIVE JASON REED ELECTED CHAIRPERSON OF THE COCA-COLA SYSTEM'S NATIONAL PRODUCT SUPPLY GROUP BOARD OF DIRECTORS", 'text': "TAMPA, FLA.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--JASON REED, SENIOR VICE PRESIDENT, PRODUCT SUPPLY NETWORK FOR COCA-COLA BEVERAGES FLORIDA, LLC (COKE FLORIDA) HAS BEEN ELECTED CHAIRPERSON OF THE COCA-COLA SYSTEM'S NATIONAL PRODUCT SUPPLY GROUP (NPSG) BOARD OF DIRECTORS. NPSG ADMINISTERS KEY NATIONAL PRODUCT SUPPLY ACTIVITIES FOR COCA-COLA SYSTEM BOTTLERS, INCLUDING PRODUCT SOURCING. FORMED AS A GOVERNING BODY IN 2015, THE BOARD CONSISTS OF REPRESENTATIVES OF THE COCA-COLA COMPANY (“TCCC”) AND ALL REGIONAL PRODUCI."}